    {
      "contract": "BackendRunHold merge preservation",
      "location": "internal/api/install_parsed_manifest.go:buildMergedSupervisorIntentFromPriorWithProjection",
      "observation": "The entire file is byte-identical to the published composition. New merged intent sets BackendRunHold to prior.BackendRunHold.clone(); other desired daemon/timer projection remains as before. The master hold.clone copies Work, so mutating the merged work item cannot mutate the prior observation.",
